Package: EmpiricalBayesianWorkflow
Title: Zero-Inflated Beta Mixed Model Workflow with Conformal Prediction
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Empirical Bayesian Workflow", "Contributor", 
           email = "example@example.com", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements a complete workflow for fitting zero-inflated beta 
    mixed models using both frequentist (glmmTMB) and Bayesian (brms) approaches.
    Includes automatic prior construction from frequentist estimates and 
    conformal prediction for uncertainty quantification.
